.TH DANBY-SKYLAB 1
.SH NAME
danby-skylab \- atmospheric orbital decay of Skylab
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/skylab
.SH MODEL
Exponential atmospheric density and quadratic drag decelerate a large satellite;
the rising density during descent creates positive feedback toward re-entry.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/skylab.b
